    "name": "Ağıllı saat Apple Watch SE 3 GPS 40mm Starlight with Starlight Sport Band - S/M (Rəsmi zəmanət)",
    "slugged_name_az": "agilli-saat-apple-watch-se-3-gps-40mm-starlight-with-starlight-sport-band-s-m-resmi-zemanet",
